        <mxCell id="title" value="Domains V2 -&gt; all-nine Foundry portfolio -&gt; operator review and learning&#10;PROPOSED logical sequence. Synthetic only. No cloud deployment performed." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=left;">
